<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells 249 tonnes of nickel.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells 249 tonnes of nickel.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 550,000 lbs of nickel, or 249 tonnes, for $1,704,763.</p>
<p>FirstMiss Steel bought 80,000 lbs at $3.21 to $3.20 a lb.</p>
<p>Wolverine Metal bought 80,000 lbs at $3.091.</p>
<p>Considar bought 390,000 lbs at $3.0797.</p>
<p>The next offering of nickel will be Aug 14.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
